Let:
- $f_i$ = fixed cost of opening facility $i$
- $K_i$ = capacity of facility $i$
- $d_j$ = demand at distribution center $j$
- $c_{ij}$ = shipping cost per unit from facility $i$ to center $j$

##### Decision Variables

- $y_i \in \{0,1\}$: 1 if facility $i$ is opened, 0 otherwise
- $x_{ij} \geq 0$: amount shipped from facility $i$ to center $j$

##### Objective

Minimize total cost (fixed + shipping):

$$
\min \sum_{i \in I} f_i y_i + \sum_{i \in I} \sum_{j \in J} c_{ij} x_{ij}
$$

##### Constraints

1. **Demand satisfaction:**  
   $$
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{ij} = d_j \qquad \forall j \in J
   $$

2. **Facility capacity (only if open):**  
   $$
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{ij} \leq K_i y_i \qquad \forall i \in I
   $$

3. **Variable domains:**  
   $$
   y_i \in \{0,1\} \qquad \forall i \in I
   $$
   $$
   x_{ij} \geq 0 \qquad \forall i \in I,\, j \in J
   $$

##### All identifiers and coefficients (source order):

- $I = \{A1, A2, A3, A4, A5, A6, A7, A8, A9, A10, A11, A12, A13, A14, A15\}$
- $J = \{B1, B2, B3, B4, B5, B6, B7, B8\}$
- $f_i$ and $K_i$ as in facility_costs.csv above
- $d_j$ as in demand_requirements.csv above
- $c_{ij}$ as in shipping_costs.csv above

##### Complete Model

$$
\begin{align*}
\min\quad & \sum_{i \in I} f_i y_i + \sum_{i \in I} \sum_{j \in J} c_{ij} x_{ij} \\
\text{s.t.}\quad
& \sum_{i \in I} x_{ij} = d_j \qquad \forall j \in J \\
& \sum_{j \in J} x_{ij} \leq K_i y_i \qquad \forall i \in I \\
& y_i \in \{0,1\} \qquad \forall i \in I \\
& x_{ij} \geq 0 \qquad \forall i \in I,\, j \in J
\end{align*}
$$

